# Artefacts

Outputs generated by Digital Geoff are saved here.

## Structure

- `/briefs/` — Daily and weekly briefs
- `/meeting-prep/` — Meeting preparation packs
- `/proposals/` — Proposals and scopes of work
- `/drafts/` — Email and document drafts
- `/status-reports/` — Project status reports

## Naming Convention

`[DATE]_[type]_[description].md`

Example: `2026-01-12_brief_daily.md`
